                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "I talked with Sterl a couiple weeks ago. He couldnt remember why he thought it was a good idea, nor come up with any use cases. ",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "As this makes the API more complicated - and I've never actually implemented the full mechanism - revert it (remove the offset facility).",
